# Claude and Anthropic URL/process list
# Sources:
# - https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/corporate-proxy
# - SukkaLab AI ruleset and observed local Surge traffic
# PROCESS-NAME rules apply on Surge Mac and are ignored by Surge iOS.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com

PROCESS-NAME,/Applications/Claude.app/
PROCESS-NAME,claude
